typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_(Animate_Dead)\" title=\"Zombie (Animate Dead)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/240px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/320px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-table\"><tbody><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-score-row\">\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>16</span></b></div> <span>(+3)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>6</span></b></div> <span>(-2)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>16</span></b></div> <span>(+3)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">INT</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>3</span></b></div> <span>(-4)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>6</span></b></div> <span>(-2)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">CHA</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>5</span></b>\n<b></b></div><b> <span>(-3)</span></b>\n</td>\n\t</tr><tr><td colspan=\"100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-divider\"><hr></td></tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>22</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>8</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slam_(Zombie)\" title=\"Slam (Zombie)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/40px-Slam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/60px-Slam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/80px-Slam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp/40px-Slam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Slam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slam_(Zombie)\" title=\"Slam (Zombie)\">Slam</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Hit a target with your bare fists. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Balthazar will always cast this spell at the first available opportunity. Each pile of bones will reanimate into one of the following: <a href=\"/wiki/Apostate_Defender\" title=\"Apostate Defender\">Apostate Defender</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Apostate_Sentinel\" title=\"Apostate Sentinel\">Apostate Sentinel</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Apostate_Destroyer\" title=\"Apostate Destroyer\">Apostate Destroyer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Apostate_Librarian\" title=\"Apostate Librarian\">Apostate Librarian</a>. The outcome for each pile of bones is fixed and predetermined.</li>\n<li>If a pile of bones is moved, the spawn point for the linked creature is moved to the same location. This can be abused by stacking multiple piles of bones on top of each other to make spawn points overlap, allowing multiple opponents to be damaged or killed quickly with area effect spells or pushing abilities like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunderwave\" title=\"Thunderwave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Thunderwave_Icon.webp/25px-Thunderwave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Thunderwave_Icon.webp/38px-Thunderwave_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Thunderwave_Icon.webp/50px-Thunderwave_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunderwave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Thunderwave_Icon.webp/25px-Thunderwave_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Thunderwave_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thunderwave\" title=\"Thunderwave\">Thunderwave</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715045642\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2625/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48312/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18183/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1604737/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n115.38%   73.543     27 Template:Trim\n100.00%   63.740      1 -total\n 99.11%   63.174      1 Template:Feature_page\n 18.98%   12.097      1 Template:Creature\n 17.69%   11.273      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.61%    9.314      1 Template:Creature/format\n 13.89%    8.851      1 Template:AttributeBlock\n 12.68%    8.082      2 Template:Resource\n 12.65%    8.060      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.29%    7.197      1 Template:SpellAction\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34701-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715045642 and revision id 280089. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\